"version8_7OnboardingCardDescription" = "1. New symptoms and events recorded in the Diary (including Covid and a generic 'other') allow you to be more precise and complete in conversations with doctors.\n
2. For those who do not have an Apple Watch, it is now possible to record the length of the seizures manually when entering it in the Diary. \n
3. Still, it is now possible to add notes to any symptom or event simply by holding down the  ⃝ button for two seconds in the Diary.\n
4. If the RealTime session is active during sleep, in addition to the heart rate, the respiratory rate, and oxygen in the blood are detected and reported in the notes at the end of the session.\n
5. It is also possible to record the weight (for example, to match the change of drugs).\n
6. Telemetry data is simpler (permanently anonymous) and helps us understand how to improve and help more and more people.\n
7. Fixed some style bugs.\n
8. If you like MirrorHR and want to give us suggestions, please know that a review and an email are always very welcome. Find the links in the Settings section.
Thank you!\n ";

