"version8_8OnboardingCardDescription" = "1. New Checklist feature that helps to create good habits, solve frequently asked questions, and participate in the community of parents and doctors that are developing MirrorHR.\n
2. For those who do not have an Apple Watch, it is now possible to record the length of the seizures manually when entering it in the Diary with just one tap.\n
3. Still, it is now possible to add notes to any symptom or event simply by holding down the  ⃝ button for two seconds in the Diary.\n
4. Respiratory rate and oxygen in the blood are now detected if the RealTime session is active during the night sleep.\n
5. It's now possible to export data and reimport them in case of moving to a new phone.\n
6. Fixed some style bugs.\n
7. If you like MirrorHR and want to give us suggestions, please know that a review and an email are always very welcome. Find the links in the Settings section.\n
Thank you!\n ";

"version9OnboardingCardDescription" = "1. New FastLog buttons (Diary View)
2. New import and export data in Excel format, with many more data (Insights and Checklist views)
3. New option for regulating the volume of alarms (Settings view)
4. New events menstruations and dermatitis (Diary View)
5. Minimum platform is now iOS 15/watchOS 7.5 (for their increased reliability and security)
6. Bug fixed: images and symbols in some devices, video log saving even without audio, seizures interval formula
7. Known issues: iPhone and Watch pairing may need a reset in some devices when there is an operating system update.
8. If you like MirrorHR and want to give us suggestions, please know that a review and an email are always welcome. Find the links in the Settings section.
Thank you!";

