"version15_WhatsNewDescription" = "Welcome to Version 15 of MirrorHR - Epilepsy Research Kit! We're thrilled to introduce our full remote monitoring system, enhancing autonomy for our kids and loved ones. In addition to logging main events, tracking medications, and therapies, you can now receive remote notifications for all these activities, including alarms and BPMs, even from miles away. This feature requires the patient to wear an Apple Watch paired with an iPhone running MirrorHR, while you, as a caregiver, only need MirrorHR on your iPhone.

As always, MirrorHR helps you gain clearer insights into epilepsy management, fostering better discussions with your healthcare provider. Your invaluable feedback has led to performance enhancements and bug fixes, making the app smoother than ever.

Love MirrorHR? Your reviews and feedback are crucial for refining the experience. Feel free to drop a review or email us your suggestions. Find the links under the Settings section. Thank you for your continued support!";


